<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure | GearPilot AI" description="How GearPilot AI handles affiliate relationships, sponsored links, and ranking independence." canonicalPath="/affiliate-disclosure/">
  <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
  <p>GearPilot AI may earn a commission when a visitor purchases through an approved affiliate link, at no additional cost to the buyer. A commission never changes a product’s eligibility, score, or order.</p>
  <h2>Current status</h2>
  <p>The public catalog currently contains synthetic demonstration records and no purchase links. Phase 3 research candidates are not purchase recommendations and do not have approved affiliate links. The affiliate-program registry lists eight merchants as not applied; GearPilot AI does not claim participation in any merchant program at this time.</p>
  <h2>How future links will work</h2>
  <p>We will show an outbound link only after the product and offer are verified, the program has approval evidence and a safe credential reference, and the exact destination host is allowlisted. Sponsored links will use <code>rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer"</code>. If no approved link is available, the page will say so rather than guessing a tracking URL.</p>
</BaseLayout>
